This build is made to solo farm the [[gww:Greater Blood Drinker|Greater Blood Drinker]] groups in the first room of [[gww:Urgoz's Warren|Urgoz's Warren]], in [[gww:Hard Mode|Hard Mode]], for [[gww:Amber Chunk|Amber Chunks]], [[gww:Category:Zodiac_weapons|Zodiac Weapons]] and other Urgoz/Deep exclusive OS weapons (like the [[gww:Exalted Aegis|Exalted Aegis]]). It'll also generate 280 [[gww:Kurzick faction|Kurzick faction]] per run.

